# Features

Folder layout:

```
lib/features/<feature>/
  data/
  domain/
  presentation/
    cubit/
    pages/
    widgets/
```

- Page = UI only. Cubit = logic. Domain = entities/use cases. Data = sources/repos.
- Skip empty layers until needed (e.g. no data folder for static UI).
- Register the page in `AppRouter` and `RouteNames` in the same change.
- Feature widgets stay inside that feature. Shared widgets go to `lib/core/`.
